# Codex CLI artifacts. .agents/ stays ignored (corrupted s/Claude/Codex/ skill
# mirrors). AGENTS.md is NOT ignored — it is a tracked symlink to CLAUDE.md so
# Codex loads identical current content (Codex verified: it ingests literal
# AGENTS.md bytes as user_instructions; a thin pointer would leave it
# context-blind). The only writer is the manual `migrate-to-codex` skill, which
# unlink()s + recreates (Codex-verified cli.py:452-470) — that SEVERS the
# symlink into a regular file = visible tracked diff, never a silent CLAUDE.md
# mutation. Restore with `git checkout AGENTS.md`. Do not run migrate-to-codex
# here. Background: docs/archive/DOCS_GROUND_TRUTH_AUDIT_2026-05-19.md.
.agents/

